{"seq":1,"slug":"form-accessibility-aria","title":"表单无障碍与 ARIA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/ux-accessibility/form-accessibility-aria","wordCount":1541,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"表单无障碍与-aria\">表单无障碍与 ARIA</h1><p>WebAIM 的百万网站报告显示，超过 50% 的 WCAG 失败出现在表单中——缺失标签、错误未关联到字段、键盘无法操作自定义控件。表单是用户与系统交换数据的唯一通道，如果这个通道对辅助技术不可见，就等于拒绝了一部分用户。本文将 WCAG 2.2 中与表单直接相关的成功准则落地为可执行的代码模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>表单无障碍的核心是把&quot;视觉上显然的信息&quot;变成&quot;程序上可读的信息&quot;，围绕三条主线：<strong>标签关联</strong>（显式 <code>for/id</code>、隐式包裹、或 <code>aria-label</code> / <code>aria-labelledby</code>，让每个输入都有可朗读的名字）、<strong>错误关联</strong>（<code>aria-invalid</code> + <code>aria-describedby</code> 指向错误消息 + <code>role=&quot;alert&quot;</code> 即时播报 + 焦点管理，四要素缺一不可）、<strong>键盘可达</strong>（Tab 顺序、具体按键行为、<code>fieldset</code>/<code>legend</code> 分组、<code>autocomplete</code> 标识输入目的）。三条主线的验证都不能只靠自动化工具——自动化只能覆盖约 30–50% 的问题，剩余部分必须用真实屏幕阅读器操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wcag-2-2-表单相关准则\">WCAG 2.2 表单相关准则</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>准则编号</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>表单中的含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1.3.1</td>\n<td>信息和关系</td>\n<td>标签与输入的程序化关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.3.5</td>\n<td>识别输入目的</td>\n<td><code>autocomplete</code> 属性标识字段语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.4.6</td>\n<td>标题和标签</td>\n<td>标签描述字段目的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.3.1</td>\n<td>错误识别</td>\n<td>错误必须用文本描述，不能仅靠颜色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.3.2</td>\n<td>标签或说明</td>\n<td>所有输入必须有标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.3.3</td>\n<td>错误建议</td>\n<td>提供修正建议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.3.7</td>\n<td>冗余输入</td>\n<td>不要重复询问已提供的信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.3.8</td>\n<td>无障碍认证</td>\n<td>认证不能仅依赖认知功能测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.5.8</td>\n<td>目标尺寸</td>\n<td>交互目标最小 24x24px，推荐 44x44px</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"标签关联的三种方式\">标签关联的三种方式</h2><h3 id=\"显式关联-推荐\">显式关联（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;label for=&quot;user-email&quot;&gt;邮箱地址&lt;/label&gt; &lt;input id=&quot;user-email&quot; type=&quot;email&quot; name=&quot;email&quot; autocomplete=&quot;email&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user-email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>邮箱地址&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user-email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>for</code> 属性与 <code>id</code> 配对——屏幕阅读器在字段获得焦点时朗读标签文本。点击标签也会聚焦到输入框（扩大了触摸目标）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"隐式包裹\">隐式包裹</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;label&gt;&#10;  邮箱地址&#10;  &lt;input type=&quot;email&quot; name=&quot;email&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/label&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  邮箱地址</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>标签包裹输入元素时无需 <code>for/id</code>。但在复杂布局中标签和输入可能在不同的 DOM 层级——此时只能用显式关联。</p>\n<h3 id=\"aria-label-aria-labelledby\">aria-label / aria-labelledby</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 搜索框无可见标签 --&gt;&#10;&lt;input type=&quot;search&quot; aria-label=&quot;搜索商品&quot; /&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 标签文本来自页面其他位置 --&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id=&quot;billing-heading&quot;&gt;账单地址&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;input aria-labelledby=&quot;billing-heading address-hint&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;span id=&quot;address-hint&quot;&gt;（省市区 + 详细地址）&lt;/span&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 搜索框无可见标签 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"search\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"搜索商品\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 标签文本来自页面其他位置 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"billing-heading\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>账单地址&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-labelledby</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"billing-heading address-hint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"address-hint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>（省市区 + 详细地址）&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>aria-labelledby</code> 可引用多个 ID，朗读时按顺序拼接。优先使用原生 <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>——ARIA 只在原生方案无法满足时使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误状态的完整关联\">错误状态的完整关联</h2><p>一个无障碍的错误状态需要同时满足四个要素：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[字段出错] --&gt; B[aria-invalid = true]&#10;    A --&gt; C[aria-describedby 指向错误消息]&#10;    A --&gt; D[错误消息包含具体修正建议]&#10;    A --&gt; E[焦点移到错误字段或摘要区]\">graph TD\n    A[字段出错] --&gt; B[aria-invalid = true]\n    A --&gt; C[aria-describedby 指向错误消息]\n    A --&gt; D[错误消息包含具体修正建议]\n    A --&gt; E[焦点移到错误字段或摘要区]</pre><h3 id=\"实现模板\">实现模板</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function AccessibleField({&#10;  label, name, error, hint, required,&#10;}: {&#10;  label: string&#10;  name: string&#10;  error?: string&#10;  hint?: string&#10;  required?: boolean&#10;}) {&#10;  const inputId = `field-${name}`&#10;  const errorId = `${inputId}-error`&#10;  const hintId = `${inputId}-hint`&#10;&#10;  const describedBy = [hint &amp;&amp; hintId, error &amp;&amp; errorId].filter(Boolean).join(&#39; &#39;) || undefined&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;label htmlFor={inputId}&gt;&#10;        {label}&#10;        {required &amp;&amp; &lt;span aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt; *&lt;/span&gt;}&#10;      &lt;/label&gt;&#10;      {hint &amp;&amp; &lt;span id={hintId}&gt;{hint}&lt;/span&gt;}&#10;      &lt;input&#10;        id={inputId}&#10;        name={name}&#10;        aria-invalid={error ? true : undefined}&#10;        aria-describedby={describedBy}&#10;        aria-required={required}&#10;      /&gt;&#10;      {error &amp;&amp; (&#10;        &lt;span id={errorId} role=&quot;alert&quot;&gt;&#10;          {error}&#10;        &lt;/span&gt;&#10;      )}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AccessibleField</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  error</span><span style=\"color: