<ul>\n<li>原生可聚焦元素（input, button, select, textarea, a）：不需要 <code>tabindex</code></li>\n<li>自定义控件：<code>tabindex=&quot;0&quot;</code> 使其进入 Tab 序列</li>\n<li><strong>永远不用 <code>tabindex &gt; 0</code></strong>——它打破自然 DOM 顺序，制造不可预测的导航体验</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"焦点管理\">焦点管理</h3><p>多步向导的步骤切换时，焦点应移到新步骤的第一个字段或步骤标题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function useStepFocus(stepRef: React.RefObject&lt;HTMLElement&gt;, step: number) {&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const heading = stepRef.current?.querySelector(&#39;h2, [role=&quot;heading&quot;]&#39;) as HTMLElement;&#10;    heading?.focus();&#10;  }, [step]);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useStepFocus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stepRef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> React</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RefObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">step</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> heading</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stepRef.current?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'h2, [role=\"heading\"]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    heading?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">focus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }, [step]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"fieldset-与-legend\">fieldset 与 legend</h2><p>相关字段应用 <code>&lt;fieldset&gt;</code> 分组，<code>&lt;legend&gt;</code> 提供组标签：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;fieldset&gt;&#10;  &lt;legend&gt;收货地址&lt;/legend&gt;&#10;  &lt;label for=&quot;street&quot;&gt;街道&lt;/label&gt;&#10;  &lt;input id=&quot;street&quot; name=&quot;street&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;label for=&quot;city&quot;&gt;城市&lt;/label&gt;&#10;  &lt;input id=&quot;city&quot; name=&quot;city&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/fieldset&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fieldset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">legend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>收货地址&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">legend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"street\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>街道&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"street\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"street\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"city\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>城市&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"city\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"city\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fieldset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>屏幕阅读器在每个字段获焦时会先朗读 legend 再朗读 label：&quot;收货地址，街道，编辑框&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>legend 冗长问题</strong>：如果 legend 超过 5-6 个词，每个字段聚焦时的重复朗读会让用户疲惫。解决方案是保持 legend 简短，补充说明放在 <code>aria-describedby</code> 指向的辅助文本中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"autocomplete-属性\">autocomplete 属性</h2><p>WCAG 1.3.5 要求标识输入目的，<code>autocomplete</code> 是主要手段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;input name=&quot;name&quot; autocomplete=&quot;name&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;input name=&quot;email&quot; type=&quot;email&quot; autocomplete=&quot;email&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;input name=&quot;tel&quot; type=&quot;tel&quot; autocomplete=&quot;tel&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;input name=&quot;street&quot; autocomplete=&quot;street-address&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;input name=&quot;cc-number&quot; autocomplete=&quot;cc-number&quot; inputmode=&quot;numeric&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tel\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tel\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"street\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"street-address\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cc-number\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cc-number\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inputmode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"numeric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span></code></pre></div><p>正确的 <code>autocomplete</code> 值让浏览器自动填充用户已保存的信息——减少输入负担、降低错误率、加速表单完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试无障碍\">测试无障碍</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>自动化程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>axe DevTools</td>\n<td>检测 ARIA 违规</td>\n<td>自动（浏览器扩展）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lighthouse</td>\n<td>无障碍评分</td>\n<td>自动（CI 集成）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VoiceOver / NVDA</td>\n<td>真实屏幕阅读器体验</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tab 键遍历</td>\n<td>键盘可达性验证</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y</td>\n<td>编码时静态检查</td>\n<td>自动（编辑器内）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>自动化工具只能发现约 30-50% 的无障碍问题——真正的验证需要用屏幕阅读器实际操作表单。<a href=\"../fundamentals/validation-strategies\">校验策略与错误处理</a> 中讨论的错误呈现模式需要在无障碍测试中验证：错误消息是否被正确朗读、焦点是否移到正确位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>标签关联有三种方式：显式 <code>for</code>/<code>id</code>、隐式包裹、<code>aria-label</code> / <code>aria-labelledby</code>；优先使用原生 <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>，ARIA 只在原生无法满足时使用。</li>\n<li>完整的错误状态需要四要素：<code>aria-invalid</code> 仅在出错时设为 <code>true</code>、<code>aria-describedby</code> 指向错误消息、错误文本含修正建议、焦点移到错误字段或摘要区。</li>\n<li>提交失败遵循五步模式：清除旧错误 → 顶部渲染摘要 → 聚焦摘要或首个错误字段 → 标记 <code>aria-invalid</code> → 字段下方显示内联错误。</li>\n<li>键盘可达性要点是永远不用 <code>tabindex &gt; 0</code>，多步向导切换时把焦点移到新步骤的标题或首个字段。</li>\n<li>相关字段用 <code>fieldset</code> + <code>legend</code> 分组，但 legend 应保持简短（5–6 词以内），避免每个字段聚焦时重复朗读。</li>\n<li>自动化工具（axe、Lighthouse、eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y）只能覆盖 30–50% 的问题，最终验证必须用真实屏幕阅读器。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"表单无障碍与 ARIA","id":"表单无障碍与-aria"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"WCAG 2.2 表单相关准则","id":"wcag-2-2-表单相关准则"},{"level":2,"text":"标签关联的三种方式","id":"标签关联的三种方式"},{"level":3,"text":"显式关联（推荐）","id":"显式关联-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"隐式包裹","id":"隐式包裹"},{"level":3,"text":"aria-label / aria-labelledby","id":"aria-label-aria-labelledby"},{"level":2,"text":"错误状态的完整关联","id":"错误状态的完整关联"},{"level":3,"text":"实现模板","id":"实现模板"},{"level":2,"text":"提交错误的五步模式","id":"提交错误的五步模式"},{"level":2,"text":"键盘导航","id":"键盘导航"},{"level":3,"text":"tabindex 规则","id":"tabindex-规则"},{"level":3,"text":"焦点管理","id":"焦点管理"},{"level":2,"text":"fieldset 与 legend","id":"fieldset-与-legend"},{"level":2,"text":"autocomplete 属性","id":"autocomplete-属性"},{"level":2,"text":"测试无障碍","id":"测试无障碍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"嵌套字段与数组表单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/complex-patterns/nested-array-fields"},"next":{"title":"自动保存与草稿恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/ux-accessibility/autosave-draft-recovery"}}